spec: examples/order-status.ears.md
scenarios: 6

R6 accepted, trigger true
No scenario satisfies every requirement while this trigger is true.

R6 accepted, trigger false
R6 has no trigger, so there is no case where the trigger is false.

R6 rejected, trigger true
{
  "status": "placed"
}
The order was placed.

R7 accepted, trigger true
No scenario satisfies every requirement while this trigger is true.

R7 accepted, trigger false
R7 has no trigger, so there is no case where the trigger is false.

R7 rejected, trigger true
Same scenario as R6 rejected, trigger true.
The order was placed.
